    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      81.84,
      424.15,
      286.44,
      445.76
    ],
    "text": "My No.: ATU/LAN/04/Do 12. Land Ministry Reference No.: 4-3/15/2015/VR/24.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      446.25,
      286.43,
      522.76
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intend to acquire the following Land/Servitude which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.079591751098633,
      5.039495944976807,
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      57.84,
      524.23,
      221.4,
      534.31
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      535.25,
      286.51,
      599.84
    ],
    "text": "The Land described below depicted in supplementary Plan No. 43 of F.V.P. No. 87 prepared by surveyor General of Matara situated at Uggashena Village in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Athuraliya in Gangabadapaththu North the District of Matara.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      609.48,
      286.44,
      676.88
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 696 Name of the land: Wilpitawaththa Kambi Adiya; Claimant: Land Reform Commission, P.O. Box 1526, No. G 82, Hector Kobbkaduwa Road, Colombo 07; Particulars of the land: Home Garden Road and Bush land; Extent 23.1977 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      360.6,
      539.43,
      447.2
    ],
    "text": "2. Lot No. 697 Name of the land: Wilpitawaththa Kambi Adiya; Claimant: Land Reform Commission, P.O. Box 1526, No. G 82, Hector Kobbkaduwa Road, Colombo 07; Particulars of the land: Home Garden and mixed Cultivation; Extent 0.0568 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      447.68,
      539.54,
      572.72
    ],
    "text": "All Persons interest in the aforesaid land/lands on which a Servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing to appear before me at the Athuraliya Divisional Secretary\u2019s on the 05th day of December, 2017 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 27th day of November, 2017 the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      573.67,
      524.52,
      659.11
    ],
    "text": "DEEPIKA K. GUNARATHNA, (Acting) Divisional Secretary, Athuraliya. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office, Athuraliya, 30th October 2017.",
